  "description": "YITAMOTOR Towing mirrors extend outward further than the standard truck mirrors, increasing your rearward vision to help provide a safer towing experience. They make perfect replacements with great upgrades that have good cost savings over the dealer parts.\nFitments\n1999-2002 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra 1500 2500\n2001-2002 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra 1500HD 2500HD 3500\n2000-2002 Chevy Suburban 1500 Suburban 2500\n2000-2000 Chevy Tahoe (excluding Z71 Models)\n2001-2002 Chevy Tahoe GMC Yukon Yukon XL Denali\n2002-2002 Chevy Avalanche 1500 2500\n2000-2000 GMC Yukon (excluding Denali Models)\n2000-2002 GMC Yukon XL 1500 2500\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nFitment: compatible with 02 Chevy Avalanche 1500 2500, 99 - 02 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra 1500 2500, 01 - 02 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra 1500 HD 2500 HD 3500, 00 - 02 Chevy Suburban GMC Yukon XL 1500 2500, 01 - 02 Chevy Tahoe GMC Yukon Yukon XL Denali, 00 Chevy Tahoe (excluding Z71 Models), 00 GMC Yukon (excluding Denali Models)\nPackage contents & dimensions: a pair of telescoping trailer tow mirrors, including driver side and passenger side; side mirror length is 16.5” (closed) and 19.25” (extended); side mirror size is 11.81”×7.09”\nFunctions: featuring power adjustable & power heated plane mirror, manually adjustable convex lens, manual telescoping & manual folding, the multifunctional side mirrors can strikingly enhance your driving experience\nEasy to install: just simply connect the plugs of the trailer towing mirror to the corresponding power cord, no drilling or modifications required（professional installation would be highly recommended）\nNote: Please check if your vehicle has the same functions as that of towing mirrors, such as turn signal, otherwise some functions of towing mirrors will be disabled when the vehicle does not possess the corresponding functions",
